; Donate when safe. Winning 42 p. 25 and p. 38 (S-0041-c: a partner with no
; trumps gives count on the trump double led on trick one), pp. 37-38
; (S-0056-a's third rule, S-0057-c, S-0057-d, S-0058-a, S-0058-b, S-0067-a);
; played in Hands 12, 14, 15, 23, 30, 31, 32 and 33 (S-0043-d, S-0046-a,
; S-0048-c: Hand 15's line B, the 5-5 on the 4-6 at trick 2, and the right
; setter's 3-2, last, on his partner's 6-6 at trick 3, S-0105-d, S-0137-b,
; S-0138-d, S-0142-f, S-0144-l), and by the last setter in Hand 29
; (S-0133-d). Biggest first: p. 37 and p. 106 (S-0057-c, S-0138-e). No count
; on a trick that can still be lost: Hand 33 (S-0144-i).
; Not encoded: the partner's throw when he holds no count at all (Hand 32
; trick 2, the 4-2, S-0142-i; Hand 31 trick 5, the 6-0, S-0140-d): no rule of
; the book's chooses it, and the book gives no reason; the policy falls back.
; Rule, in our words: count goes only on a trick your side is sure to take.
; The bidder's partner gives count, the biggest first, when the bidder is
; taking the trick and no setter still to play can beat him: he led the
; highest trump still out; or he led trump and the setters have shown out of
; it; or the setters have shown out of trump and his tile is the top of its
; suit. A seat playing last gives count to his partner's trick. When the trick
; can still be lost, the partner plays no count if he has the choice.
; Replaces gates/c01b-partner-count-on-a-trump-lead.silas and
; gates/c03-biggest-count-first.silas. How it differs from them: the gates read
; trump leads only and "the bidder is winning so far". The book's safe trick is
; any trick the partner can prove from his own chair (a non-trump double after
; the setters show out of trump, Hand 30 trick 5); a low trump lead is safe
; once both setters have shown out of trump, where the gate's not-top branch
; withholds count (S-0058-b, S-0057-d); and the last setter gives count to his
; partner's trick (Hand 29 trick 1), which no gate has.

(include book)

(policy donate-when-safe
  (rule give-a-ten (play give)
    (pattern
      (viewer me)
      (bidders-partner me)
      (safe-trick)
      (own-legal give)
      (count give 10))
    (pattern
      (viewer me)
      (setter me)
      (last-to-play)
      (partner-winning)
      (own-legal give)
      (count give 10)))
  (rule give-a-five (play give)
    (pattern
      (viewer me)
      (bidders-partner me)
      (safe-trick)
      (own-legal give)
      (count give 5))
    (pattern
      (viewer me)
      (setter me)
      (last-to-play)
      (partner-winning)
      (own-legal give)
      (count give 5)))
  (rule no-count-on-a-trick-that-can-be-lost (play give)
    (viewer me)
    (bidders-partner me)
    (bidder-winning)
    (not (safe-trick))
    (own-legal give)
    (count give 0)
    (own-legal held)
    (count-tile held)))
